    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.starter\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.12.x\n\n### Description\n\nIt seems that the mini.starter plugin no longer renders itself after :restart in version 0.12.5.\n\n### Reproduction\n\n1. Create minimal lua config:\n```lua\nvim.pack.add({ 'https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim' })\n\nrequire('mini.starter').setup()\n```\n\n2. Open neovim\n\n3. Press ZZ or type :restart\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e5f46b0f-3b64-4706-bbdd-efe09f93fccd\n",
